  "verse": 1,
  "quick_english": "Now, for those standing in lower doctrines, even up to gurus — immediately after death, solely by the power-descent arisen for raising the dead, let him perform the initiation called the final sacrament; and for those standing in higher doctrines, who have lost their observance and performed no expiation — thus is the Lord's command.",
